{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a courier. A working unit. A small expendable cog in an endless megastructure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your task is simple: sort, clean, deliver.<br>The System observes. The System controls. The System never rests.<br>Be grateful to the System for its care.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cargo must be delivered across the factory levels. Archive data collected.<br>Do not look inside the crates. Do not ask who whispers in the tunnels. Do not linger when the lights go out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember: <strong>cargo has priority. You do not.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The disobedient are recycled. The obedient\u2026 recycled slower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The truth is hidden in the archives. Will you dare to find it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Genre and Style:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric first-person horror.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visual style \u2014 dark pseudo-PS1 aesthetics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay: sorting, delivery, cleaning, exploration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story unfolds through archive records, environment, and system directives.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054200/extras/ba8978eb68285aece6bebdf599007862.avif?t=1759252784\" width=622 height=770 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4054200?t=1759252784","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054200/4f9ef8ce9e3e90121548ec47c2a86b704976a241/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759252784","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054200/73bffe060b51b0d50d52b7f662bd43d37078aa0c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759252784","capsule_imag